org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/04\/lola-optimized-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__image wp-block-getwid-banner__source wp-image-40223\"\/><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__caption\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__caption-wrapper\"><span class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__title\"><br>Every voice is seen, heard, and valued  <\/span><p class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__text\">We honour lived experience, celebrate individual strengths, and put people at the centre of everything we do<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-none getwid-padding-bottom-none getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-none getwid-padding-mobile-left-none\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px;margin-top:10px\"><h2 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Our approach is non-judgmental and deeply supportive. We are a trusted partner for those navigating poverty, violence, and systemic barriers.<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-42bd8ff018171798a84a87d462070fb2\">We understand that poverty, homelessness, and gender-based violence are symptoms of gender inequity and the systems that perpetuate them. We know that restoring choice, confidence, and agency is what creates sustainable pathways out of poverty.&nbsp;<br><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:1140px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-100-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:47px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-heading-page-title\">OUR VALUES<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-805592892aee314377274f8d8437f23d\">Our work is guided by values and principles that centre humanity, dignity, and self-determination. These values inform how we engage with communities, design solutions, and advance equity. Grounded in gender justice and an intersectional feminist approach, our programs empower women and gender-diverse people facing multiple barriers to build sustainable pathways out of poverty.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color has-custom-black-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Respect &amp; Belonging<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-91b1df1d9d03076a093d120325f4474f\">Every voice is seen, heard, and valued; we honour lived experience, celebrate individual strengths, and put people at the centre of everything we do.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color has-custom-black-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-fist-raised\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Agency &amp; Empowerment<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4d7967ffd8a24a19ff1c8f34cbce20f4\">We prioritize self-determination, choice, and the freedom to define and pursue personally meaningful goals.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color has-custom-black-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-people-carry\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Community &amp; Collaboration<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ab228dac130fa1addcc9c4e5a8d5aed4\">Trust, shared responsibility, and collective care drive our work and impact.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color has-custom-black-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-book-reader\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Integrity &amp; Learning<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a3ede98205390baa0f3ab64616a43275\">We act with honesty, transparency, and accountability, continuously evolving through reflection and feedback.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color has-custom-black-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-child\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Inclusion &amp; Openness<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-655452697eee1fe87ca8859ccb68d40d\">We embrace diverse perspectives and experiences to foster understanding, inform solutions, and create meaningful change.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:47px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:1140px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-100-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-heading-page-title\">OUR PRINCIPLES<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-default has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0429de27e87630dbb82d00cd04d521fb\">Our principles translate these values into action.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;color:#000000;border-radius:78%\"><i class=\"fas fa-transgender-alt\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Intersectional Feminism<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2666e1b90334847cad219d80485e12f8\">We recognize that intersecting identities\u2014across gender, race, age, sexual orientation, disability, health, income, and immigration status\u2014create unique challenges for those we serve.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;color:#000000;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Gender Justice &amp; Equity<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-dcdd9523f3a5dbbe375113741a9016be\">We envision a future where all women and gender-diverse people have opportunities to define and achieve their own version of success.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;color:#000000;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Community-Led Solutions<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-57d33aae253eb0208c34535be53e73a8\">We believe real change comes from community-driven approaches, rooted in solidarity and informed by lived experience.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-3-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;color:#000000;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Challenging Systemic Discrimination<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-951dadca22461745db7f00fd3d191b61\">We actively identify, challenge, and address harmful social structures that create barriers to opportunity, economic wellbeing, and long-term stability for women and gender-diverse people.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box has-text-center\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-container has-layout-framed is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__icon-wrapper has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:40px;padding:15px;color:#000000;border-radius:80%\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"><\/i><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-icon-box__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading\"><h3 class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading__content\">Truth and Reconciliation<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4ed1b8ff60c467db5f943507668f53c1\">We are committed to pursuing truth and reconciliation with Indigenous communities, and recognize colonialism\u2019s role in perpetuating gender inequity.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-normal getwid-padding-bottom-normal getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:740px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-200-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-heading has-custom-font-size\" style=\"font-size:1.75em;margin